# Environment files - DO NOT COMMIT CREDENTIALS
# ================================================
# Staging and production credentials must never be committed to git.
# Store credentials securely in environment, vault, or host configuration.
# Templates (.example) are safe to commit; actual credentials are not.
.env
.env.*
# Except example/template files
!.env.*.example